From df02ada153730476d6d2535411f483e86c1a5349 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayesh Rathod <jayesh4.rathod@ril.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 13:11:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 04/14] Apply the tradeability gateway to the NSE Momentum
 Ladder

Step 5 of the Cross-Scanner Eligibility and Corporate Lifecycle Sprint.

The Ladder was the most exposed of the three. old_nse_hull.discovery.discover
applied exactly three filters -- history >= 67 sessions, close >= 50, 20-day
mean volume >= 50,000 -- with no series check, no security-master join, no
blacklist and no per-symbol price freshness. Because its history requirement is
only 67 sessions rather than V3's 260, far more dead symbols survived it.

On the real CSV store at market date 2026-08-20 the gateway removed 112 stale
symbols the Ladder was ranking on their final close, plus JBCHEPHARM, plus 223
non-EQ series and 159 restricted symbols.

Report dating bug
-----------------
DiscoveryResult.as_of_date was read off whichever symbol ranked first
(result["as_of_date"].iloc[0] after sorting by score). A stale symbol that
ranked highest therefore dated the entire report from its own last bar. It is
now the universe's newest completed session, and DiscoveryResult carries an
explicit market_date. Asserted both gated and ungated.

Changes
-------
* old_nse_hull/discovery.py -- discover() accepts the verdict; gateway reason
  codes are merged into the existing rejection counters rather than a parallel
  report; shortlist rows carry entry_permitted and instrument_class.
* old_nse_hull/engine.py -- run_local() runs the gateway once before any
  strategy rule. paper_entry_enabled now requires READY *and* entry permission,
  so an observe-only symbol can reach READY without becoming a paper entry.
  The report gains market_date, tradeability and entry_withheld.
* old_nse_hull/multi_horizon/engine.py -- run_shadow() drops non-admitted
  symbols before latest_features, so a stale symbol cannot contribute a feature
  row or distort a percentile rank. Observe-only symbols are added to
  blocked_symbols so they stay visible without entering the paper ladder.

The module-level claim of V2 isolation is narrowed to strategy and state: the
gateway is data-layer admission control, and per docs/LEGACY_CODE_POLICY.md
shared logic belongs under v2/. pine_hull already imports v2.database.

Tests: 12 new; the 20 existing old_nse_hull tests still pass unchanged.
